   study, test and modify the Software for their own personal, private use.

3. Uses that require prior written permission
   The following uses are not permitted without the Owner's prior written
   permission, whether paid or free of charge:
   a. Any commercial use, including use within a business or organization, or
      as part of a product or service.
   b. Public use, including operating the Software or any part of it as a
      service available to others.
   c. Distributing, publishing or selling the Software, any part of it, or a
      modified version, including publishing a fork as a standalone project.
   d. Incorporating components, code or design from the Software into another
      project, free or paid.
   Permission requests: cs@abaye.co

4. Contributions
